# Fashion Brand Features — Implementation Plan

## Scope
Add the key frontend features from [fashion_brand_website_features.md](file:///e:/Desktop%20folders/react_app/Juba_Store/fashion_brand_website_features.md) to the existing [juba_store.html](file:///e:/Desktop%20folders/react_app/Juba_Store/juba_store.html). Backend-dependent features (payments, real order tracking, admin dashboard) are mocked as UI only.

## Already Implemented ✅
- Add to cart + side-drawer cart
- Product grid with hover animations
- Newsletter signup
- Mobile-responsive layout
- Footer with links

---

## Features to Add

### 1. Product Details — Quick View Modal
- Click a product card → opens a full-screen modal
- Shows: large image, size selector (S/M/L/XL/XXL), size chart toggle, fabric info, stock indicator, description
- "Add to Cart" button inside the modal

### 2. Wishlist System
- Heart icon on each product card
- Saves to `localStorage`
- Visual feedback (filled heart)

### 3. Flash Deal / Countdown Timer Section
- New section between products and kids section
- Countdown timer (24h) with a featured product
- Urgent CTA styling

### 4. Product Filtering / Category Tabs
- Tab bar above product grid: "الكل | Top Wear | Footwear | Kids"
- Filters products dynamically

### 5. WhatsApp Chat Button (Floating)
- Fixed bottom-left green WhatsApp button
- Opens `wa.me` link

### 6. Promo Popup (First Visit)
- Modal popup on first visit (uses `localStorage`)
- "Get 15% off your first order" with email input
- Dismiss button

### 7. Social Proof Toast Notifications
- Small toast at bottom: "أحمد من القاهرة اشترى Oversized T-Shirt منذ 3 دقائق"
- Cycles through fake data every 8 seconds

### 8. Product Reviews Section
- Star ratings display on product cards
- Review count badge

---

## Verification
- All features work without a backend (localStorage + JS only)
- Responsive on mobile
- Animations are smooth and premium
